				Time="2011-05-30T07:16:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>電光掲示板　みてる？▼
大量発生した　ポケモンの
ニュースが　いま　熱いんだダヨ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-30T07:16:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
