				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T06:00:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あっ　はい！▼
では　この　タマゴを
よろしく　お願い　します！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-11T11:41:23" />
